.PS
# basic/acrlc.cir drawn: a 2 V / 45 degree drive into a pair of 10u
# coils coupled by k = 0.3; the secondary rings a series 5 ohm /
# 253.3p branch (f0 = 3.16 MHz) and a VCVS (x2) buffers the secondary
# into RE. Card order kept; deck nodes 1 In, 2 Pri, 3 Sec, 4 Vc,
# 5 Vout.
spice = 1
In:   (0.3,2)
Pri:  (1.4,2)
Sec:  (2.4,2)
Vc:   (3.5,2)
Vout: (5.1,2)

Vin: acsource(In, (0.3,0), ac 2 45)
RS: resistor(In, Pri, 50)
L1: inductor(Pri, (1.4,0), 10u)
L2: inductor(Sec, (2.4,0), 10u)
K12: coupling(L1, L2, 0.3)
RL: resistor(Sec, Vc, 5)
C2: capacitor(Vc, (3.5,0), 253.3p)
E1: vcvs(Vout, (5.1,0), (4.6,1.2), (4.6,0.8), 2)
RE: resistor((6.3,2), (6.3,0), 1k)

line from Sec to (2.4,2.6) then to (4.3,2.6) then to (4.3,1.2) then to E1.Cp
line from E1.Cn to (4.3,0.8) then to (4.3,0)
line from E1.P to RE.P
line from Vin.N to RE.N
dot at Sec
dot at L1.N; dot at L2.N; dot at C2.N; dot at (4.3,0); dot at E1.N
ground((0.85,0))
.ac lin 50 1meg 5meg
.PE
